DevOps Engineers (1–3 Years of Experience) interview Questions.

If you’re preparing for interviews or looking to strengthen your fundamentals, start focusing on real-time scenarios, CI/CD workflows, cloud basics, and production-ready troubleshooting.
Here are some solid DevOps interview questions that companies love asking 👇

Questions:

How does your CI/CD pipeline look end-to-end?

What steps do you follow when a production deployment fails?

How do you secure secrets in your pipeline?

Explain the difference between blue-green and rolling deployments.

How do you monitor logs and metrics in production?

What challenges have you faced while using Jenkins/GitHub Actions?

How do you handle versioning of infrastructure using Terraform?

What happens inside Kubernetes when you apply a Deployment?

How do you optimize Docker images in real projects?

Explain how you handle high traffic or scaling issues.

How do you reduce Docker image size in real projects?

Explain what happens when you push code to GitHub Actions workflow.

How do you handle secret rotation in your CI CD pipeline?

What is the difference between StatefulSet and Deployment in Kubernetes?

How do you troubleshoot a pod stuck in ContainerCreating state?

Explain how you design a simple CI CD pipeline for a microservice.

How do you set resource requests and limits in Kubernetes and why?

What is the difference between ClusterIP, NodePort, and LoadBalancer service?

How do you handle zero downtime deployment in Kubernetes?

Explain how Terraform manages state and what issues you have faced with it.

How do you rollback a failed deployment in Kubernetes?

Explain how you monitor CPU and memory usage of pods.

How do you automate server provisioning using Terraform?

Explain the difference between Git rebase and Git merge.

How do you debug a failing Jenkins pipeline stage?

Explain the concept of environment variables in containers.

How do you implement canary deployment in a project?

What is the difference between horizontal pod autoscaling and vertical autoscaling?

How do you configure health checks in Kubernetes?

Explain the CI CD flow for a Node.js or Java application you worked on.
